BPSec / BPLib Integration
Maintained by banderson777.

This integration contains local additions and modifications to components from:
- NASA BPLib: https://github.com/nasa/bplib
- NASA BPNode: https://github.com/nasa/bp
- NASA Core Flight System and Core Flight Executive:
  https://github.com/nasa/cFS and https://github.com/nasa/cFE
- NASA AMMOS Bundle Protocol Security Library (BSL):
  https://github.com/NASA-AMMOS/BSL

Original copyright, license and notice files remain with each component.
BSL includes work copyrighted by The Johns Hopkins University Applied Physics
Laboratory LLC and performed for NASA/JPL under the notices in its source.
Local modifications are described in docs/ and the component commit histories.
Additional dependencies retain their own licenses and attribution.
See THIRD_PARTY.md and DEPENDENCIES.lock.json for provenance.
